PR #31 — Registry expansion to 100+ countries
Branch: feat/registry-40               Depends on: #30               Status: TODO
───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
DESCRIPTION
  The grind, and the moat. Every spec verified against the issuing authority's
  own page, with the URL and the date recorded. No spec enters without a source.

  TARGET RAISED from 40 to 100+, on competitive evidence. PhotoAiD and Visafoto
  both cover 200+ document types. Every country we do not cover is a bounce from
  a visitor who already found us — and the long tail is the ONLY ground a new
  domain can win, because the head terms belong to incumbents for years.
  Under-covering the tail forfeits the one advantage available to us.

  This is also the single biggest lever on revenue. Ad income is a function of
  traffic, traffic is a function of pages that can rank, and each verified
  country is one such page.
EDGE CASES
  [ ] Authority pages that state requirements only in a PDF
  [ ] Rules differing for applications filed abroad
  [ ] Child and infant exemptions
  [ ] Countries permitting or requiring glasses
  [ ] Non-white background requirements (light grey, cream, light blue)
  [ ] Countries that mandate a physical print and reject digital entirely
TESTS  Every spec parses; a snapshot test catches accidental edits.

